#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: zinn-campaigns.php
msgid "Zinn® Campaigns – Email & SMS Marketing for WooCommerce & More"
msgstr "Zinn® Campaigns – Email & SMS Marketing for WooCommerce & More"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: zinn-campaigns.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-campaigns"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-campaigns"

#. Description of the plugin
#: zinn-campaigns.php
msgid "Connect your WordPress site or WooCommerce store to Zinn® Campaigns in one click and grow your list with double opt-in sign-up forms. Email, SMS and WhatsApp campaigns are sent from your Zinn® Campaigns account."
msgstr "Koppel je WordPress-site of WooCommerce-winkel met één klik aan Zinn® Campaigns en laat je lijst groeien met dubbele opt-in-aanmeldingsformulieren. E-mail-, SMS- en WhatsApp-campagnes worden verzonden vanuit je Zinn® Campaigns-account."

#. Author of the plugin
#: zinn-campaigns.php
msgid "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"
msgstr "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: zinn-campaigns.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:38
#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:39
#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:209
#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:228
msgid "Zinn® Campaigns"
msgstr "Zinn® Campaigns"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:90
msgid "You are not allowed to manage Zinn® Campaigns on this site."
msgstr "Je hebt geen toestemming om Zinn® Campaigns te beheren op deze site."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:106
msgid "This site is connected to Zinn® Campaigns."
msgstr "Deze site is verbonden met Zinn® Campaigns."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:107
msgid "This site is disconnected. Sign-up forms stop sending new sign-ups to Zinn® Campaigns."
msgstr "Deze site is losgekoppeld. Aanmeldformulieren stoppen met het verzenden van nieuwe aanmeldingen naar Zinn® Campaigns."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:108
msgid "That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again."
msgstr "Die verbinding duurde te lang of is gestart in een andere browser. Druk opnieuw op Verbinden."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:109
msgid "Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support."
msgstr "Zinn® heeft de verbinding niet geaccepteerd. Druk nogmaals op Verbinden; neem contact op met Zinn®-ondersteuning als het blijft mislukken."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:110
msgid "Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again."
msgstr "Je site kon Zinn® niet bereiken. Controleer of je host uitgaande verbindingen toestaat en druk vervolgens op «Opnieuw verbinden»."

#. translators: %s: the add-on plugin's brand name, Zinn® Campaigns Pro.
#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:156
#, php-format
msgid "The %s add-on"
msgstr "De %s-add-on"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:160
msgid "You get Pro free with any paid Zinn® Campaigns plan: there is no separate licence to buy. Pro is a separate add-on plugin you download from your Zinn® dashboard."
msgstr "Je krijgt Pro gratis bij elk betaald Zinn® Campaigns-abonnement: er hoeft geen afzonderlijke licentie te worden gekocht. Pro is een afzonderlijke add-on plugin die je downloadt vanaf je Zinn®-dashboard."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:162
msgid "Included: your account has a paid Zinn® Campaigns plan."
msgstr "Inbegrepen: je account heeft een betaald Zinn® Campaigns-abonnement."

#. translators: %s: the date the free Pro trial ends.
#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:166
#, php-format
msgid "Free trial until %s. Pick any paid Zinn® Campaigns plan to keep Pro after that."
msgstr "Gratis proefperiode tot %s. Kies een willekeurig betaald Zinn® Campaigns-abonnement om Pro daarna te behouden."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:168
msgid "Not included right now: the free trial has ended or the plan is not paid. Your Pro settings are kept and come back the moment a paid plan is live."
msgstr "Momenteel niet inbegrepen: de gratis proefperiode is afgelopen of het abonnement is niet betaald. Je Pro-instellingen blijven bewaard en keren terug zodra een betaald abonnement actief is."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:170
msgid "Connect this site to see what your plan includes."
msgstr "Verbind deze site om te zien wat je abonnement inhoudt."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:173
msgid "Download the Pro add-on"
msgstr "Download de Pro-add-on"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:174
msgid "See Zinn® Campaigns plans"
msgstr "Bekijk Zinn® Campaigns-abonnementen"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:181
msgid "Sign-up forms"
msgstr "Aanmeldformulieren"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:182
msgid "Add the \"Zinn® Campaigns sign-up form\" block to any page or post, or paste a shortcode below. Every sign-up gets a confirmation e-mail first (double opt-in), and only people who confirm join your list."
msgstr "Voeg het blok 'Zinn® Campaigns-aanmeldingsformulier' toe aan een pagina of bericht, of plak hieronder een shortcode. Elke aanmelding ontvangt eerst een bevestigingsmail (dubbele opt-in), en alleen mensen die bevestigen worden aan je lijst toegevoegd."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:185
msgid "Your account has no sign-up forms yet. Create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Campaigns, Forms, then press Refresh."
msgstr "Je account heeft nog geen aanmeldingsformulieren. Maak er een aan in je Zinn®-dashboard onder Campagnes, Formulieren, en druk vervolgens op Vernieuwen."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:188
#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:185
msgid "Form"
msgstr "Formulier"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:188
msgid "List"
msgstr "Lijst"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:188
msgid "Shortcode"
msgstr "Shortcode"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:212
msgid "Grow your list on this site with double opt-in sign-up forms, and send email, SMS and WhatsApp campaigns from your Zinn® Campaigns account."
msgstr "Laat je lijst op deze site groeien met double opt-in-aanmeldformulieren en verstuur e-mail-, SMS- en WhatsApp-campagnes vanuit je Zinn® Campaigns-account."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:213
msgid "Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this site, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key."
msgstr "'Verbinden' opent Zinn® in dit venster. Meld je aan of maak een account aan, keur deze site goed en je komt direct weer hier terug. Je hoeft nooit een sleutel te plakken."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:214
msgid "Connect to Zinn® Campaigns"
msgstr "Verbinden met Zinn® Campaigns"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:221
msgid "Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly."
msgstr "Verbonden, maar Zinn® kon zojuist niet worden bereikt. We proberen het binnenkort opnieuw."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:225
msgid "Site"
msgstr "Site"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:226
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Verbonden"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:230
msgid "Open for your account"
msgstr "Geopend voor je account"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:231
msgid "Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is."
msgstr "Nog niet beschikbaar voor jouw account. Zinn® stuurt je een e-mail zodra het zover is."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:235
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Vernieuwen"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-admin.php:238
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Verbinding verbreken"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-connect.php:80
msgid "You are not allowed to connect this site."
msgstr "Je hebt geen toestemming om deze site te verbinden."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-connect.php:160
msgid "You are not allowed to disconnect this site."
msgstr "Je hebt geen toestemming om deze site los te koppelen."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:126
msgid "Zinn Digital®"
msgstr "Zinn Digital®"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:151
#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:183
msgid "Zinn® Campaigns sign-up form"
msgstr "Zinn® Campaigns-aanmeldingsformulier"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:173
msgid "Choose a form"
msgstr "Kies een formulier"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:184
msgid "A double opt-in sign-up form from your Zinn® Campaigns account."
msgstr "Een double opt-in-aanmeldingsformulier van je Zinn® Campaigns-account."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:186
msgid "Sign-up form"
msgstr "Aanmeldformulier"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:249
msgid "Zinn® Campaigns: connect this site and choose one of your forms to show a sign-up form here."
msgstr "Zinn® Campaigns: verbind deze site en kies een van je formulieren om hier een aanmeldingsformulier weer te geven."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:256
msgid "Sign up"
msgstr "Registreren"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:262
msgid "Thank you. Check your inbox and click the link in our e-mail to confirm."
msgstr "Bedankt. Controleer je inbox en klik op de link in onze e-mail om te bevestigen."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:279
msgid "Leave this empty"
msgstr "Laat dit leeg"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-forms.php:280
msgid "E-mail address"
msgstr "E-mailadres"

#. translators: %s: the Zinn Digital trade mark, which is not translated.
